# March of the Machines: "Each noncreature artifact is an artifact creature with power and toughness each equal to its mana
# value." Layer 4 adds Creature, layer 7b sets the size (CR 613.6, 613.4b), to the artifacts the layer-4 part applied to.
# - Sol Ring (mana value 1) is a 1/1 artifact creature, Chromatic Lantern ({3}) a 3/3; Bot2's are too ("each").
# - The four Moxes and Darksteel Citadel, an artifact land, have mana value 0: 0/0, put into the graveyard (CR 704.5f, the
#   ruling) - indestructible does not save a creature with 0 toughness. The Citadel is still a land as it dies.
# - Ornithopter is already an artifact creature, so March does not apply to it: it stays 0/2.
# - Sol Ring, a creature that came under Bot1's control this turn, has summoning sickness: its {T} ability can't be
#   activated (the ruling, CR 302.6); Chromatic Lantern, there since an earlier turn, taps for mana (the positive control).

